B. Where the number can be computed: TRUE, READ and CHECK (K = 8 touches at fresh azimuths, touch noise 0.02) for the judge-only map, b1 = 0.06, N = 3
   true 54.3   read 18.2   check 56.0
   (the READ score says the map is at the judge noise floor; the CHECK score sees what the READ score cannot)

